{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42342","headline":"忆新淦觞池寄孟宾于员外 · 徐铉","name":"忆新淦觞池寄孟宾于员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往年淦水驻行轩，引得清流似月圆。\n自有谿光还碧甃，不劳人力递金船。\n润滋苔藓欺茵席，声入杉松当管弦。\n珍重诗人频管领，莫教尘土咽潺潺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}